{"ticker":"GS","updated":"2026-10-23T23:03:18Z","profile":{"longName":"The Goldman Sachs Group, Inc.","shortName":"Goldman Sachs Group, Inc. (The)","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Capital Markets","country":"United States","website":"https://www.goldmansachs.com","fullTimeEmployees":47500,"marketCap":254972968960,"trailingPE":12.590653,"forwardPE":11.818899,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.5893486,"pegRatio":1.12,"targetMeanPrice":1031.1428,"targetHighPrice":1250.0,"targetLowPrice":730.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":21,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.233,"earningsGrowth":0.388,"grossMargins":0.81287,"operatingMargins":0.38244998,"profitMargins":0.31208,"totalRevenue":71036002304,"beta":1.284,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":1153.99,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":754.0,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.24},"summary":"The Goldman Sachs Group, Inc., a financial institution, provides a range of financial services for corporations, financial institutions, governments, and individuals in the Americas, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, and Asia. It operates through three segments: Global Banking & Markets, Asset & Wealth Management, and Platform Solutions. The Global Banking & Markets segment provides financial advisory services, including strategic advisory assignments related to mergers and acquisitions, divestitures, corporate defense activities, restructurings, and spin-offs; equity and debt underwriting of public offerings and private placements; relationship lending and acquisition financing; secured lending through structured credit and asset-backed lending, such as warehouse, residential and commercial mortgage, corporate, consumer, auto, and student loans; financing through securities purchased under agreements to resell; and commodity financing through structured transactions. This segment also offers client execution activities for cash and derivative instruments; credit and interest rate products; and provision of mortgages, currencies, commodities, and equities related products. Its Asset & Wealth Management segment manages assets across various classes, including equity, fixed income, hedge funds, credit funds, private equity, real estate, currencies, commodities, and asset allocatio","summary_zh":"高盛集團是一家金融機構，為美洲、歐洲、中東、非洲和亞洲的企業、金融機構、政府和個人提供一系列金融服務。它透過三個部門運作：全球銀行與市場、資產與財富管理、平台解決方案。全球銀行與市場部門提供財務諮詢服務，包括與併購、資產剝離、企業防禦活動、重組和分拆相關的戰略諮詢任務；公開發行和私募的股權和債務承銷；關係貸款和收購融資；透過結構性信貸和資產支持貸款提供擔保貸款，例如倉庫貸款、住宅和商業抵押貸款、企業貸款、消費者貸款、資金透過貸款和學生出售資金透過證券交易；該部門也為客戶提供現金和衍生性工具的執行活動；信貸和利率產品；以及提供抵押、貨幣、商品和股票相關產品。其資產與財富管理部門管理各種類別的資產，包括股票、固定收益、對沖基金、信貸基金、私募股權、房地產、貨幣、大宗商品和資產配置。","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"資本市場","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":741.89,"h":746.5,"l":738.33,"c":738.79,"v":1381200},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":737.71,"h":749.16,"l":733.86,"c":748.95,"v":1511600},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":745.97,"h":753.0,"l":745.02,"c":749.67,"v":1534800},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":750.99,"h":753.33,"l":746.99,"c":751.22,"v":1411200},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":746.71,"h":748.92,"l":738.9,"c":745.25,"v":1467000},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":736.39,"h":736.39,"l":721.16,"c":730.85,"v":2296400},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":728.56,"h":732.02,"l":722.3,"c":730.56,"v":1485600},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":733.75,"h":748.91,"l":731.17,"c":748.9,"v":1778200},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":752.19,"h":757.35,"l":727.15,"c":738.21,"v":1822800},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":739.42,"h":743.54,"l":733.57,"c":741.85,"v":1400100},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":740.13,"h":765.62,"l":738.54,"c":763.92,"v":2611300},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":761.86,"h":774.47,"l":761.63,"c":769.58,"v":1996200},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":772.0,"h":793.17,"l":771.35,"c":784.73,"v":2075700},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":783.5,"h":787.03,"l":776.26,"c":780.06,"v":1099400},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":782.95,"h":792.38,"l":781.44,"c":786.76,"v":1292000},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":789.53,"h":790.01,"l":779.69,"c":785.53,"v":1529500},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":788.86,"h":798.57,"l":785.23,"c":794.22,"v":1945300},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":795.57,"h":807.28,"l":792.4,"c":804.31