kJnTEZYX3ZCMkhQV1dFX2pjVk9CcWhUR2h0MnRWeDVDSGlMNUxud0E1ZWVYX3p3MUxFSE96R3VENm9TYk1HMUE?oc=5","date":"2026-10-13","zh":"高盛第三季獲利攀升 29%，股票交易收入飆漲 72%"},{"title":"Goldman Sachs Group, Inc. (The) (GS) Stock Forecasts","src":"Yahoo! Finance Canada","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxOUFVPc0dzTFB4U1hjY2g0T3BQbGlZQWVpS2VQWXQzMGhXX05WQXZKYS1kcEtoMEtPU2VIeFVSV2t2a3EzWmluSjh4RXlidmZ0aE9laXQ5eEZaNnJfd0tyQl84NExISE9Qa2dZSDdsbV9uMS1nemphVHlGTlBvcXFXZUczVnJKUW5XR01sbzBBME4?oc=5","date":"2026-10-13","zh":"高盛集團 (GS) 股票預測"},{"title":"Elon Musk won’t break the AI-fueled debt boom","src":"macau daily times 澳門每日時報","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxNM1RNa1Exc0xwQVlJUWdEUHNyaUt6VllacnVJZGM0M3hkN0gweVE4MHhaTDdWM3NjVTZLN0NFY0IzbVc2anNNaURYLVEyelRjckkyMW1jQW1TX0JEVWloQWxralQwU3E0MkEzR3ZWUXBFSDBubHBMSkcxM3VwM0dXa093VjU2VXM?oc=5","date":"2026-10-09","zh":"伊隆馬斯克不會打破人工智慧推動的債務熱潮"},{"title":"RBC’s Decade of Growth Puts It in Goldman’s Market-Value League","src":"Bloomberg.com","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxOWXh1SnZodUJvaHgxYmlrQmg5LVZjSXZPZHZJT3lHU3Z3ODFCMElpdEJjalBQR1ZGSVI0ck1FejQ5R1MyTUVvMG5ycDJtNlIwNEhHTzlBRkppOUdYSjVpVGVELWlSRHNMUy1WY2pYNi00TGlsTWs2WTg0NExLQWNxb2I0WWR3TWlLZUsxY0hhYWl6aTM5NnRkb01DTC1JYzdGWmVHckxPQnlpWDdxaUNNR050TGk?oc=5","date":"2026-10-08","zh":"加拿大皇家銀行十年的成長使其躋身高盛市值聯盟"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":3},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":2},{"name":"分析師評等","count":2}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-25","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/886982/000088698226000091/gs-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Goldman Sachs is a leading global financial institution that delivers a broad range of financial services to a large and diversified client base that includes corporations, financial institutions, governments and individuals. Our purpose is to advance sustainable economic growth and financial opportunity. Our goal, reflected in our One Goldman Sachs initiative, is to deliver the full range of our services and expertise to support our clients in a more accessible, comprehensive and efficient manner, across businesses and product areas.","zh":"高盛是一家全球領先的金融機構，為包括企業、金融機構、政府和個人在內的龐大且多元化的客戶群提供廣泛的金融服務。我們的目標是促進永續的經濟成長和金融機會。我們的目標體現在「One Goldman Sachs」計畫中，即提供全方位的服務和專業知識，以更便捷、全面和高效的方式跨業務和產品領域為客戶提供支援。"},{"en":"When we use the terms \"Goldman Sachs,\" \"we,\" \"us,\" \"our\" and \"the firm,\" we mean The Goldman Sachs Group, Inc. (Group Inc. or parent company), a Delaware corporation, and its consolidated subsidiaries. When we use the term \"our subsidiaries,\" we mean the consolidated subsidiaries of Group Inc. References to \"this Form 10-K\" are to our Annual Report on Form 10-K for the year ended December 31, 2025. All references to 2025, 2024 and 2023 refer to our years ended, or the dates, as the context requires, December 31, 2025, December 31, 2024 and December 31, 2023, respectively.","zh":"當我們使用「高盛」、「我們」、「我們的」和「公司」等術語時，我們指的是特拉華州高盛集團公司（集團公司或母公司）及其合併子公司。當我們使用「我們的子公司」一詞時，我們指的是 Group Inc 的合併子公司。所提及的「本 10-K 表格」是指我們截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日止年度的 10-K 表格年度報告。所有提及 2025 年、2024 年及 2023 年均指我們的截至年度或日期（視上下文而定）：2025 年 12 月 31 日、2024 年 12 月 31 日及 12 月分別為 2023 年 3 月 31 日。"},{"en":"Group Inc. is a bank holding company (BHC) and a financial holding company (FHC) regulated by the Board of Governors of the Federal Reserve System (FRB). Our U.S. depository institution subsidiary, Goldman Sachs Bank USA (GS Bank USA), is a New York State-chartered bank.","zh":"Group Inc. 是一家受美國聯邦儲備系統理事會 (FRB) 監管的銀行控股公司 (BHC) 和金融控股公司 (FHC)。我們的美國存款機構子公司高盛美國銀行（GS Bank USA）是一家紐約州特許銀行。"}],"markets":[{"en":"We manage and report our activities in three business segments: Global Banking & Markets, Asset & Wealth Management and Platform Solutions. Global Banking & Markets generates revenues from investment banking fees, including advisory, and equity and debt underwriting fees, Fixed Income, Currency and Commodities (FICC) intermediation and financing activities and Equities intermediation and financing activities, as well as relationship lending and acquisition financing (and related hedges), investing activities related to our Global Banking & Markets activities and transaction banking. Asset & Wealth Management generates revenues from management and other fees, incentive fees, private banking and lending and investments. Substantially all of the revenues in Platform Solutions are from activities related to issuing credit cards to and raising deposits from Apple Card customers and related to","zh":"我們管理和報告三個業務部門的活動：全球銀行與市場、資產與財富管理、平台解決方案。全球銀行與市場業務的收入來自投資銀行費用，包括諮詢、股票和債務承銷費用、固定收益、貨幣和商品 (FICC) 中介和融資活動以及股票中介和融資活動，以及關係貸款和收購融資（及相關對沖）、與我們的全球銀行與市場活動和交易銀行業務相關的投資活動。資產與財富管理的收入來自管理費和其他費用、激勵費、私人銀行業務以及貸款和投資。平台解決方案的幾乎所有收入都來自與向 Apple Card 客戶發行信用卡和籌集存款相關的活動以及與"},{"en":"Beginning with the fourth quarter of 2025, we made certain changes to our segments as we continued to narrow our strategic focus with respect to consumer-related activities within Platform Solutions. The primary changes within our segments are as follows:","zh":"從 2025 年第四季開始，我們對平台解決方案中消費者相關活動的策略重點不斷縮小，並對各部門進行了一些調整。我們部門的主要變化如下："}],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"The financial services industry and all of our businesses are intensely competitive, and we expect them to remain so. Our competitors provide investment banking, market-making and asset management services, private banking and lending and other wealth advisory services, commercial lending, credit cards, transaction banking, deposit-taking and other banking products and services, and make investments in securities, commodities, derivatives, real estate, loans and other financial assets. Our competitors include brokers and dealers, investment banking firms, commercial banks, credit card issuers, insurance companies, investment advisers, mutual funds, hedge funds, private equity funds, private credit funds, merchant banks and financial technology and other internet-based companies. Some of our competitors operate globally and others regionally, and we compete based on a number of factors, i","zh":"金融服務業和我們所有的業務都競爭激烈，我們預計這種情況將持續下去。我們的競爭對手提供投資銀行、做市和資產管理服務、私人銀行和貸款及其他財富諮詢服務、商業貸款、信用卡、交易銀行、吸收存款和其他銀行產品和服務，並投資於證券、商品、衍生性商品、房地產、貸款和其他金融資產。我們的競爭對手包括經紀商和交易商、投資銀行公司、商業銀行、信用卡發行機構、保險公司、投資顧問、共同基金、對沖基金、私募股權基金、私人信貸基金、商業銀行和金融科技等網路公司。我們的一些競爭對手在全球範圍內開展業務，而另一些則在區域範圍內開展業務，我們的競爭基於多種因素，我"},{"en":"We have faced, and expect to continue to face, pressure to retain market share by committing capital to businesses or transactions on terms that offer returns that may not be commensurate with their risks. In particular, corporate clients seek such commitments (such as agreements to participate in their loan facilities) from financial services firms in connection with investment banking and other assignments.","zh":"我們已經面臨並且預計將繼續面臨壓力，透過向企業或交易提供資本，以提供可能與風險不相稱的回報來保留市場份額。特別是，企業客戶在投資銀行和其他業務方面尋求金融服務公司的此類承諾（例如參與其貸款便利的協議）。"}],"segments":{},"peers":["MS","JPM","WFC","C","AXP"]}}